WEBVTT

00:01:57.572 --> 00:02:00.491
AK: (Laughs)

00:02:00.533 --> 00:02:02.702
FO: You know what you're doing.

00:02:03.202 --> 00:02:08.207
AK: Well, being on stage
for me is the most important thing.

00:02:08.541 --> 00:02:10.751
I hate to be in studio,

00:02:10.751 --> 00:02:13.504
but I've had to learn throughout the years

00:02:13.504 --> 00:02:16.716
that I need to be in the studio
to be able to perform,

00:02:16.757 --> 00:02:17.925
to be on stage.

00:02:18.843 --> 00:02:23.264
And that energy that we're talking about,
the public give it to me.

00:02:23.264 --> 00:02:24.599
I can't keep it.

00:02:25.224 --> 00:02:26.642
If I keep it, I will explode.

00:02:26.642 --> 00:02:28.060
I mean, just face it.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.771
And I can't sleep,
like, when I finish a concert,